## 8. Quick Interview Revision

```text
Authentication → Who are you?
Authorization  → What can you do?

HPA → More/Less Pods
VPA → More/Less CPU/RAM

DaemonSet → Pod on every eligible node

Node Group → Group of worker nodes

Spot → Cheap but interruptible

ETCD → Cluster state
Scheduler → Selects node
Kubelet → Manages Pods on node
CNI → Pod networking
```

### Golden Interview Line

> **EKS management mainly focuses on security, version upgrades, scaling, node management, high availability and continuous cost optimization.**
